    "text": "These former Greater Naugatuck area high school standouts will be competing on Saturday, Dec. 13.\nAkili Evans\nLenoir-Rhyne Bears\nGuard and forward\nSenior\n6′5″ 185\nHoly Cross High School\nHometown: Waterbury\nNext Game: vs. UVA Wise Cavaliers, Saturday, Dec. 13, 4 p.m.\nCaleb Sampson\nPost Eagles\nGuard\nSenior\n6′2″ 190\nSacred Heart High School\nHometown: Waterbury\nNext Game: vs. Jefferson Rams, Saturday, Dec. 13, 3 p.m.\nNevin Kinsey\nPost Eagles\nGuard\nFreshman\n5′11″ 155\nCrosby High School\nHometown: Waterbury\nNext Game: vs. Jefferson Rams, Saturday, Dec. 13, 3 p.m.",
